# Source-available placeholder licence

**Status: placeholder — must be replaced before the first public release
(roadmap O-01 / P7-01).**

`Development.md` §1.1 requires the product to be free and open source. The
specific licence has not been chosen by the human partner. Do not treat this file
as a grant of rights.

## Intended direction

The project intends to ship under a permissive open-source licence so that users
can inspect, build and modify the application they run on their own hardware.
The remaining question is whether a copyleft component chosen for playback
(such as an LGPL/GPL-licensed media library — see `docs/decisions/0002-playback-engine.md`)
constrains that choice in practice.

## What must happen before release

- [ ] Confirm the playback engine's licence obligations (ADR-0002).
- [ ] Confirm every third-party dependency's licence is compatible with the
      chosen project licence.
- [ ] Select the licence with the human partner's explicit approval.
- [ ] Replace this file with the real licence text.
- [ ] Populate `docs/decisions/` with the attribution and NOTICE requirements.
- [ ] Verify the installer bundles the required notices (P7-01).

## Until then

This repository is a work in progress. No warranty is provided. Nothing here may
be redistributed as a licensed product, and no licence is granted by implication
or otherwise.

